Not much to say about this ascention. I got the idea from another post
a few days ago, and just added 4 conducts (I think they are usually
counted as 5, but whatever): genoless, polyselfess, polyitemless,
wishless.

Reflectionless being the most important part of the ascention, I never
had reflection for even an instant, which implied not testing amulets
until id of "oR (which I Id'd by getting "oR sokoban).
The trickiest part would be getting desintegration resistance (an
earlier fail at doing so cost me a previous try at reflectionless
ascention, and would have made for a funniest post), but I eventually
entered (with stealth) on a throne room and cast finger-of-death on a
black D.

I did get some help, as my only magic marker was found on a bones (and
it came at 0:99 at that, never saw that before), though I only used
it just before the ascention run for some ?oEA and +oID and +oRemove
curse (not so much useful spells at that time, but I like them).

I also found +oTeleportAway on the run, which I used some times since
I had my wands inside my bag most of the time.

Oh, and the right altar had some black D around :)

